# Project Context — evergreen-design-system-doc

## Origin

Standalone doc site **split from** `evergreen-design-system-desktop/apps/website`. Do **not** edit the desktop repo. Historical paths like `apps/website/src/...` in old notes map to **`src/...`** in this repo.

## Repository boundary (核心原则)

**从 `evergreen-design-system-website` 只引用规范包：**

| 允许引用 | 包名 |
|----------|------|
| Tokens | `@evergreen/tokens` |
| 组件 | `@evergreen/components` |
| 场景化组件 | `@evergreen/scenes` |

**其余一切均在本文档站仓库内实现** — 壳层、布局、导航、Markdown、动效、主题、文档内容、路由、编辑器集成等，不得放在 website 或 desktop 仓库。

```
website 仓库 = 仅 packages/（tokens + components + scenes）
doc 仓库   = 文档站应用 + 所有 doc 专属代码
```

## Sibling layout (required)

```
Projects/
  evergreen-design-system-doc/        ← this repo (app)
  evergreen-design-system-website/  ← design system packages only
```

- Tokens: `link:../evergreen-design-system-website/packages/tokens`
- Components / scenes: link same way when doc needs them (not wired yet)
- `predev` / `prebuild` run `pnpm --dir ../evergreen-design-system-website build:tokens`
- Dev: `pnpm dev` → **http://localhost:5176/**

## Module map (doc-owned, canonical paths)

| Area | Path | Notes |
|------|------|-------|
| Markdown | `src/markdown/` | `renderMarkdown`, `docMarkdown.module.css` |
| Motion | `src/motion/` | `useCurvedPanelTransition`, page enter |
| Theme | `src/composables/useTheme*.ts` | Doc-owned |
| Person avatar | `src/personAvatar/` | `@/personAvatar` |
| Shell colors | `src/styles/global.css` | Hardcoded P3 — `hardcoded-shell-colors.mdc` |
| Token aliases | `src/styles/token-aliases.css` | Desktop-era names → Website semantic |
| Layout | `src/layouts/DocsLayout.*` | Molde shadow on `contentShell` — frozen |
| Rules | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | Frozen specs; globs use `src/**` |

## Spacing / typography conventions

- **Halve doc content spacing** by smaller token **names** (`spacing-5` → `spacing-2-5`), not parent `--spacing-*` overrides on `.contentShellDoc`.
- Hover on nav/menu: `var(--event-hover)`.
- Common sizes: 14px `footnote-large`, 16px `body-small`, 18px `body-medium`, 24px `title`, 32px `title-medium`, 64px `headline-large`.
- Inline code: hardcoded `1px 6px` + `border-radius: 6px`.

## Component doc naming

- **目录 slug** = 组件英文名（meta **名称**）的 kebab-case，如 `Data Submission` → `data-submission`
- **ID** = `eds-{prefix}-{slug}`（vars / mol / org / tmpl / biz …）
- 侧栏 **中文 label** 可与组件名不同；路由仍用 slug。详见 `component-doc-naming.mdc`

## Frozen rule files

- `website-token-dependency.mdc` — website 三包边界
- `component-doc-naming.mdc` — 组件文档 slug / 名称 / ID
- `doc-markdown.mdc`, `docs-layout-molde-shadow.mdc`, `person-avatar.mdc`
- `hardcoded-shell-colors.mdc`, `corner-smoothing.mdc`, `display-p3-color-usage.mdc`, `no-text-break-on-nav.mdc`
